@startuml
' Настройка темной темы
!theme cyborg
skinparam BackgroundColor #1e1e24
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12

' Стилизация линий и текста
skinparam SequenceLineColor #555566
skinparam SequenceArrowColor #00ADB5
skinparam SequenceActorBorderColor #00ADB5
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #4E342E
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #00ADB5
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #222831

' Стилизация блоков текста/примечаний
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #393E46
skinparam NoteBorderColor #00ADB5
skinparam NoteFontColor #EEEEEE

autonumber

actor "Java Client / Orchestrator" as Client #00ADB5

box "Kyuubi Infrastructure" #252A34
    participant "Kyuubi Server\n(REST Endpoint)" as Kyuubi #3F72AF
end box

box "Compute Cluster" #2B2E4A
    participant "Spark Batch Application\n(YARN / Kubernetes)" as Engine #903749
end box

== <color:#00ADB5>Phase 1: Submit Batch Job</color> ==

Client -> Kyuubi : POST /api/v1/batches (JSON payload)
activate Kyuubi #3F72AF
Kyuubi -> Engine ** : Submit Spark Job (via spark-submit background process)
Kyuubi --> Client : HTTP 201: Return Batch JSON [id, state=PENDING/RUNNING]
deactivate Kyuubi

note left Client #222831
  **Client thread is FREE.**
  The HTTP connection is closed.
  No risk of connection timeouts.
end note

== <color:#00ADB5>Phase 2: Asynchronous Polling & Logging</color> ==

loop While state == PENDING or RUNNING
    Client -> Kyuubi : GET /api/v1/batches/{batchId}
    activate Kyuubi #3F72AF
    Kyuubi --> Client : HTTP 200: Return Batch JSON [state=RUNNING]
    deactivate Kyuubi

    Client -> Kyuubi : GET /api/v1/batches/{batchId}/localLog?from=-1&size=1000
    activate Kyuubi #3F72AF
    Kyuubi --> Client : HTTP 200: Return chunk of Spark application logs
    deactivate Kyuubi

    note over Client : Pause (Sleep 5-10 sec)
end

== <color:#00ADB5>Phase 3: Automated Job Completion</color> ==

Engine -> Engine : Execution finished (Success or Failure)
Engine --> Kyuubi : Update state in Kyuubi metadata storage
destroy Engine

Client -> Kyuubi : GET /api/v1/batches/{batchId}
activate Kyuubi #3F72AF
Kyuubi --> Client : HTTP 200: Return Batch JSON [state=FINISHED or ERROR]
deactivate Kyuubi

note over Client #222831
  **Note on Results:**
  Unlike JDBC, Spark Batch jobs write results
  directly to target storage (Hive, Delta, S3, HDFS).
  They do not return a final dataset over HTTP.
end note

@enduml
